[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/ui/style_picker_popup.gd" id="1"]

; The long-press style picker (style-picker sub-project B2, Task 7). No scrim ColorRect —
; see style_picker_popup.gd's own header for why: this reads as a lightweight dropdown, not
; a modal, so the only visible chrome is Panel/Scroll/List. OutsideCatcher still covers the
; full rect (transparent — no `color` set, unlike FactCard's/MenuWindow's tinted Scrim) so an
; outside tap is consumed rather than falling through to a palette button or a world tile.
